    "/blend/feedback": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "智能配煤"
        ],
        "summary": "化验结果回流，触发增量学习",
        "description": "化验数据闭环（4.1.7节）：\n\n1. 取该批次当时的预测值 → 2. 计算误差 → 3. 超阈值写入误差缓冲区(Redis)\n→ 4. 缓冲区满 BUFFER_TRIGGER_SIZE 条触发增量微调（LightGBM热启动，小学习率防遗忘）。",
        "operationId": "feedback_blend_feedback_post",
        "requestBody": {
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LabFeedback"
              }
            }
          },
          "required": true
        },
        "responses": {
