        "description": "查询两级预警告警（4.3.2节），响应契约见 docs/API文档.md §5。\n\n数据源：PostgreSQL pdm_alarm 表（方案§3.4.6）；level 为严重度，\n两级分类在 source 字段（level1_anomaly 实时异常 / level2_trend_forecast 趋势分级）。",
        "operationId": "list_alarms_pdm_alarms_get",
        "security": [
          {
            "HTTPBearer": []
          }
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "equipment_id",
            "in": "query",
            "required": false,
            "schema": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                {
